# DB_TABLE_PREFIX

Runtime table names are `${DB_TABLE_PREFIX}_*`. `drizzle.config.ts` uses `tablesFilter: [`${prefix}_*`]`.

- **New app / prefix change:** use `pnpm db:push` unless generating fresh migrations with `.env` already set.
- Committed SQL in `drizzle/*.sql` may use an old sample prefix; do not assume it matches the current app.

# Env (build-time)

`next.config.ts` imports `src/env.js`. Vercel must define `DATABASE_URL`, `DB_TABLE_PREFIX`, `AUTH_SECRET` (and `AUTH_URL` for production auth). Neon integration vars like `cc_POSTGRES_URL` are not read unless copied into `DATABASE_URL`.
